{"root":"bocah","ipa":"/bo.tʃah/","core":"指代幼小的孩子或儿童，通常带有非正式或亲昵的色彩，有时也指代心智尚未成熟的人。","pos":["名词"],"scenes":["高频","生活"],"rootBlock":{"ipa":"/bo.tʃah/","zh":"孩子，儿童","phrases":[{"t":"bocah kecil","zh":"小孩子"},{"t":"bocah ingusan","zh":"乳臭未干的小孩"},{"t":"kenakalan bocah","zh":"儿童顽皮行为"}],"examples":[{"t":"Bocah itu sedang bermain bola di lapangan.","zh":"那个孩子正在操场上踢球。"},{"t":"Jangan bersikap seperti bocah.","zh":"别表现得像个孩子一样。"}]},"ders":[{"w":"bocah","ipa":"/bo.tʃah/","zh":"孩子","phrase":{"t":"bocah nakal","zh":"淘气的孩子"},"example":{"t":"Bocah itu sangat cerdas.","zh":"那个孩子非常聪明。"}},{"w":"kebocahan","ipa":"/kə.bo.tʃa.han/","zh":"孩子气，幼稚的行为","phrase":{"t":"sikap kebocahan","zh":"幼稚的态度"},"example":{"t":"Dia sering menunjukkan sikap kebocahan saat marah.","zh":"他生气时经常表现出孩子气。"}}],"derSlugs":["bocah","kebocahan"],"model":"gemini-3.1-flash-lite","createdAt":"2026-09-26T16:13:45.109Z","src":"base"}